>**Increases Maximum Resources.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Rasdinice}.
* Speak to {n:Chauxnatte} (K-10). She will give you the option to decide which fort you want to ride to.
* You will start in {z:East Ronfaure (S)}. Please keep in mind that even though the NPC does not mention it, you are under a strict time limit. Being very familiar with the route you need to take is highly recommended.
* Once you've reached the fort head towards the {p:Campaign Arbiter|Campaign Arbiters} to receive a cut scene.
* Report back to {n:Rasdinice} to receive your reward.

=2 Notes
* {z:East Ronfaure (S)} : Success in 1 minute 0 seconds ~ 1 minute 10 seconds
* {z:Jugner Forest (S)} : Success in 4 minutes 13 seconds, failed in 4 minutes 23 seconds
* {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} : Success in 7 minutes 53 seconds, failed in 8 minutes 10 seconds
* {z:Batallia Downs (S)} : Success in 7 minutes 34 seconds, failed in 7 minutes 52 seconds

=2 Objective
Bracing for the possibility of prolonged besiegement from the beastmen, work has commenced on increasing the storage capacity of Allied strongholds by way of expanding provision storehouses. Deilver the necessary construction materials by chocobo to one of our nation's areas.
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
